  "description": "Compound File Binary (MS-CFB) reader and OLE payload extraction for DocWright: the container that legacy .doc and .xls files, encrypted Office files and embedded objects sit inside. Lists and opens a container's streams and pulls the original file out of an embedded OLE object. Treats its input as untrusted: traversal is bounded and declared sizes are checked before anything is allocated. No third-party dependencies.",
